---
import { ArrowRight, Server, Cpu, ShieldCheck, Zap, CheckCircle2 } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="about" class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 relative">
  <div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">
    {/* Section Header */}
    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-[var(--nt-border)] bg-white dark:bg-[#1F1D19] text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0] shadow-sm">
        <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#FACC15]"></span>
        <span>LOCAL_RUNTIME_ARCHITECTURE</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">
        Your files never touch a remote server
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#454038] dark:text-[#CBC4B6] leading-relaxed">
        Traditional online converters upload private documents to remote clusters, exposing sensitive records to retention and queues. NovaTools brings the desktop engine directly to your machine.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* BLOCK 1: Cloud vs Local Architecture */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 nt-window overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-[var(--nt-border)] px-5 py-3 bg-[#FCFBF8] dark:bg-[#191714] text-xs font-mono">
          <span class="font-bold text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">DATA_FLOW_VERIFICATION</span>
          <span class="nt-badge-success px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold">SANDBOXED</span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5">
          <div class="nt-well h-56 p-5 flex flex-col justify-center items-center space-y-6">
            <div class="flex justify-between w-full max-w-sm px-2 items-center">
              <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center">
                <div class="nt-card h-12 w-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#141413] text-[#FACC15] border-[#141413]">
                  <Cpu class="h-5 w-5" />
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">Local Device</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#15803D] dark:text-[#4ADE80]">Active Memory</span>
              </div>

              <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-3 relative">
                <div class="w-full h-px border-t-2 border-dashed border-[#746D61]/40 relative">
                  <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#FEF2F2] dark:bg-[#7F1D1D]/60 border border-[#FECACA] dark:border-[#F87171]/40 text-[10px] font-bold text-[#B91C1C] dark:text-[#FCA5A5] font-mono shadow-sm">
                    BLOCKED
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center opacity-50">
                <div class="nt-card h-12 w-12 flex items-center justify-center text-[#746D61]">
                  <Server class="h-5 w-5" />
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">Cloud Server</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#746D61]">0 Bytes Sent</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center font-mono text-xs text-[#454038] dark:text-[#CBC4B6] max-w-xs leading-relaxed">
              Every operation runs inside isolated browser RAM and clears on tab close.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-4 text-left">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">
          Complete data sovereignty & confidentiality
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#454038] dark:text-[#CBC4B6] leading-relaxed">
          When converting legal contracts, financial PDFs, medical images, or private audio, you should never have to upload files across public networks.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#454038] dark:text-[#CBC4B6] leading-relaxed">
          NovaTools compiles engines directly for client-side execution so your hardware performs all decoding, synthesis, and rendering locally.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a href="/privacy" class="nt-btn-secondary inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold">
            <ShieldCheck class="h-4 w-4 text-[#15803D] dark:text-[#4ADE80]" />
            <span>Read Privacy Manifesto</span>
            <ArrowRight class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="laser-divider"></div>

    {/* BLOCK 2: Performance Benchmark */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-4 text-left order-2 lg:order-1">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">
          Native speed without file caps or queues
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#454038] dark:text-[#CBC4B6] leading-relaxed">
          Cloud converters throttle upload speed and enforce waiting rooms. NovaTools accesses your CPU and WebGPU directly for instant desktop responsiveness.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-2.5 pt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0] font-medium">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <CheckCircle2 class="h-4 w-4 text-[#CA8A04] dark:text-[#FACC15] shrink-0" />
            <span>Zero network upload or download bottlenecks</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <CheckCircle2 class="h-4 w-4 text-[#CA8A04] dark:text-[#FACC15] shrink-0" />
            <span>Multi-threaded background Web Workers</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <CheckCircle2 class="h-4 w-4 text-[#CA8A04] dark:text-[#FACC15] shrink-0" />
            <span>100% free with no daily limits or watermarks</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 nt-window overflow-hidden order-1 lg:order-2">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-[var(--nt-border)] px-5 py-3 bg-[#FCFBF8] dark:bg-[#191714] text-xs font-mono">
          <span class="font-bold text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">PERFORMANCE_BENCHMARK</span>
          <span class="nt-badge-yellow px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold">17x FASTER</span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5">
          <div class="nt-well h-56 p-5 flex flex-col justify-center space-y-5">
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-semibold">
                <span class="text-[#454038] dark:text-[#CBC4B6]">Cloud Services (Upload + Queue + Download)</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-[#746D61]">14.2s</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full bg-white dark:bg-[#1F1D19] rounded-full h-3 p-0.5 border border-[var(--nt-border)]">
                <div class="bg-[#A8A092] dark:bg-[#514A40] h-full rounded-full" style="width: 85%"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-extrabold text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <Zap class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-[#CA8A04] dark:text-[#FACC15]" />
                  NovaTools (Local Memory)
                </span>
                <span class="font-mono">0.8s</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full bg-white dark:bg-[#1F1D19] rounded-full h-3 p-0.5 border border-[var(--nt-border)]">
                <div class="bg-[#FACC15] h-full rounded-full shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]" style="width: 14%"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-2 text-center font-mono text-[11px] text-[#746D61] dark:text-[#938B7D] border-t border-[var(--nt-border)]">
              * Measured on 50MB multi-page document sequence
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
